=== (a) exact T(V') vs 1/49, and the closed form ===
  closed form T(V')=(1+2R)/(7V')-R(R+1)/V'^2, R=floor((V'-1)/7): VERIFIED V'=1..399
  max |T(V')-1/49| over V'=1..399 = 0.12245 at V'=1
  max |T(V')-1/49|*V' over V'=1..399 = 0.1224  => |T(V')-1/49| <= 0.122/V'
  small V': T(1)=0.1429 T(2)=0.0714 T(7)=0.0204 T(14)=0.0204  (1/49=0.0204)

